{"result":{"acceptance_year":null,"advert_code":"864","advert_description":"Dovolujeme si V\u00e1m nab\u00eddnout k prodeji investi\u010dn\u00ed bytov\u00fd d\u016fm s 5 bytov\u00fdmi jednotkami se zahradou, po rozs\u00e1hl\u00e9 rekonstrukci o celkov\u00e9 v\u00fdm\u011b\u0159e 931m2, v ulici Pra\u017esk\u00e1, \u00dast\u00ed nad Labem - centrum. Skladba bytov\u00fdch jednotek:\r\n3+kk o podlahov\u00e9 v\u00fdm\u011b\u0159e  85m2,\r\n5+kk o podlahov\u00e9 v\u00fdm\u011b\u0159e 145m2,\r\n3+1 o podlahov\u00e9 v\u00fdm\u011b\u0159e   96m2,\r\n1+1 o podlahov\u00e9 v\u00fdm\u011b\u0159e   45m2,\r\n2+1 o podlahov\u00e9 v\u00fdm\u011b\u0159e   75m2. \r\nCelkov\u00e1 podlahov\u00e1 plocha byt\u016f \u010din\u00ed 446m2.\r\nV\u0161echny bytov\u00e9 jednotky jsou obsazeny plat\u00edc\u00edmi n\u00e1jemn\u00edky. Aktu\u00e1ln\u00ed m\u011bs\u00ed\u010dn\u00ed v\u00fdnos \u010din\u00ed 96.000,- K\u010d. P\u0159i nab\u00eddkov\u00e9 cen\u011b p\u0159edstavuje orienta\u010dn\u00ed hrub\u00fd v\u00fdnos p\u0159ibli\u017en\u011b 6.1%. D\u016fm pro\u0161el v uplynul\u00fdch letech rozs\u00e1hlou rekonstrukc\u00ed. Sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed prodeje je zahrada o v\u00fdm\u011b\u0159e 553m2 s vjezdovou br\u00e1nou, mo\u017enost\u00ed parkov\u00e1n\u00ed pro cca 10 aut a venkovn\u00edm posezen\u00edm. Stavebn\u00ed dokumentace a n\u00e1jemn\u00ed smlouvy budou v\u00e1\u017en\u00e9mu z\u00e1jemci na vy\u017e\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159edlo\u017eeny. Z dlouhodob\u00e9ho hlediska zaj\u00edmav\u00e1 investice, v z\u00e1vislosti na poloze domu a vysok\u00e9ho r\u016fstu ceny v \u010dase. Spr\u00e1vu nemovitost\u00ed V\u00e1m v p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b z\u00e1jmu zajist\u00edme. Zaj\u00edmav\u00e1 investice, v\u0159ele doporu\u010dujeme. Bli\u017e\u0161\u00ed informace u makl\u00e9\u0159e.","advert_images":[{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"","height":960,"id":1016692493,"kind":2,"order":1,"url":"//d18-a.sdn.cz/d_18/c_img_qG_C/nPQ64TBsMvNXddDyqIISNFg/72ad.jpeg","width":1280},{"ai_edited":false,"alt":"",